
   Hierapolis Linux — Live Environment
   ==============================

   Install:   hierapolis-install
   Package:   vpm -Syu          (pacman wrapper)
   Desktop:   systemctl start lightdm   (xfce / hierapolis ISOs)
              hierapolis-session             (Hierapolis DE from tty, labwc)

   Root login has no password on the live medium.

   "Badger doesn't care. Badger builds."
